isoforge (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Grant the release workflow the permissions its called workflows declare.
    Every run had been rejected at startup, so no package had ever been built.

 -- Nikola Reljin <nikola.reljin@gmail.com>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

isoforge (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add `isoforge build`, which remasters an Ubuntu or Xubuntu base image into
    a custom installable ISO from a recipe.
  * Recipes describe packages, apt sources, overlay files and chroot hooks, and
    can drive a NikOS Ansible playbook or read a distrodeck export.
  * Add Xubuntu 24.04, Xubuntu 26.04 and Ubuntu 26.04 to the distro catalog.

 -- Nikola Reljin <nikola.reljin@gmail.com>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

